<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span><span id="A2.T7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Switching from ROUGE to <math id="A2.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}_{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}_{W}</annotation></semantics></math> changes the ranking of methods.</span> We show the ranking change for the FB and QA sets from RWKU on transitioning from ROUGE to worst-case accuracy by Judge (<math id="A2.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}_{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}_{W}</annotation></semantics></math>) as a metric. Colored number indicates the relative change in rank.</figcaption>
