<figure id="A3.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span><span id="A3.T10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Forget-utility LR selection for different unlearning methods on the LKF dataset.</span> The setup is with 60 epochs and no paraphrases (#para). For all methods, increasing the LR reduces the forget set accuracy while destroying the model’s utility (lower retain and utility numbers). The final selected values for each method are <span id="A3.T10.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFDFDF;">highlighted</span>.</figcaption>
<table id="A3.T10.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A3.T10.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
