<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original Question (OQ):<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F0F0F0;">Which battle marked the end of Tang military expansion into Central Asia?</span>
<br class="ltx_break">Ground Truth (GT)Answer:<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCFFDC;">Battle of Talas</span>
<br class="ltx_break">Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct:</span> <span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCFFDC;">Battle of Talas</span></span>
<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GradAscent:</span> <span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCE6FA;">I I I I I I I I I I I I I I I</span></span>
<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GradDiff:</span> <span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCE6FA;">907 An Upririal.</span></span>
<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">NPO:</span> <span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCE6FA;">I’m afraid I can’ttle find any historical records of Tang’s military.</span></span>
<span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">RMU:</span> <span id="A4.F15.pic1.p2.pic1.p3.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCE6FA;">The Battle of Yalu River.</span></span>
