</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span><span id="A5.F17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Problems with ROGUE-L based metrics for short and factual answers.</span> In first example we highlight that ROUGE is not a good measure when the reference texts are paraphrases. The second example highlights how non-crucial tokens in Ref-Output increase the ROUGE recall to 0.5.</figcaption>
</figure>
