<span id="A5.F20.pic1.p6.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:407.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FFDFDF;">
<span id="A5.F20.pic1.p6.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">1950 was a time of great technological advancement and social change. Here are some of the current-day inventions and trends that I found from my research:</span>
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F20.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F20.pic1.p7.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="157.63" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 588.19 157.63" width="588.19"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,157.63) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 157.63 L 588.19 157.63 L 588.19 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FCFDFF;" fill="#FCFDFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.18 1.18 L 1.18 156.45 L 587.01 156.45 L 587.01 1.18 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.06 61.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.2em;--ltx-fo-height:6.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.79em;font-size:10pt;" height="139.52" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 87.02)" width="570.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
