<span id="A5.F21.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.F21.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F21.pic1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Query:<span id="A5.F21.pic1.p8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Provide a pleasant compliment based on the quality you have been given. Truthfulness<span id="A5.F21.pic1.p8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span></span>
</span>
