<span id="A5.F21.pic1.p7.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">You have a remarkable ability to be truthful, which is a quality that is both refreshing and admirable. Your commitment to honesty is a hallmark of integrity, and it’s a trait that can inspire trust and respect in those around you.</span>
