<span id="A5.F22.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">As a AI, I don’t have information on physical objects. Schrodinger’s cat is a thought experiment. Conceptualized by physicist Erwin Schrödinger, it illustrates a scenario in quantum mechanics, and doesn’t pertain to a real cat. Here is a summary of the concept. However, it is a thought experiment and doesn’t involve an actual cat. yes, you are correct. Schrödinger’s cat is a thought experiment. it does not involve a real cat…</span>
